window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Strange magic? Check. A brother who's still a cat? Check. A cryptic message from an ex-husband who's in trouble? Wait… what?</b></p> <p>Morgan and her ex-husband broke up on bad terms. But when he sends her a cryptic message, Morgan knows that whatever trouble he's in, it's likely her fault. Over Ruiner's protests, she ventures beyond Hollowbeck's borders to find him.</p> <p>But instead of finding him, she finds a dead body.</p> <p>Then she finds the Oubliette, an exclusive gambling club in the town of Darrowdale, which is a mirror image of Hollowbeck—only with a decidedly more dangerous population.</p> <p>Treachery, dangerous deals, and soul-stealing coffee are all in the cards as Morgan and Ruiner try to find her ex-husband while staying one step ahead of the killer.</p> <p>But the killer has plans that go beyond murder, and if they get their way, both Hollowbeck and Darrowdale will be lost forever.</p> <p>Life's a Witch <i>is the third book in the Hollowbeck Paranormal Cozy Mysteries series from Amelia Ash and bestselling author Kim M. Watt.</i></p>"; 
